<app-header title="榜单" transparent />
<view class="page tab-page ranking-page">
  <view class="period-switch glass-card">
    <button wx:for="{{periods}}" wx:key="value" class="period {{period === item.value ? 'period--active' : ''}}" data-period="{{item.value}}" bindtap="changePeriod">{{item.label}}</button>
  </view>
  <button class="rules-link" bindtap="toggleRules">排行规则　ⓘ</button>
  <view class="podium-stage">
    <view wx:for="{{podiums}}" wx:key="rank" class="podium podium--{{item.rank}}" data-id="{{item.artworkId}}" bindtap="openArtwork">
      <text class="crown">♕<text>{{item.rank}}</text></text>
      <view class="podium-image-wrap"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill" /></view>
      <text class="podium-title">{{item.title}}</text>
      <text class="podium-heat">♥ {{item.heat}}</text>
      <text class="podium-author">{{item.author}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="ranking-list glass-card">
    <view wx:for="{{ranking}}" wx:key="rank" class="ranking-row" data-id="{{item.artworkId}}" bindtap="openArtwork">
      <text class="rank-number">{{item.rank}}</text>
      <image class="rank-image" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill" />
      <view class="rank-copy"><text class="rank-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="rank-subtitle">{{item.subtitle}}</text><text class="rank-author">{{item.author}}</text></view>
      <text class="rank-heat">♡ {{item.heat}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{showRules}}" class="rule-mask" bindtap="toggleRules">
  <view class="rule-dialog" catchtap="noop"><text class="rule-title">榜单规则</text><text>榜单按公开热度规则生成，不因个人用户而变化。当前页面为开发示例，正式计算口径和更新时间以后端规则为准。</text><button bindtap="toggleRules">知道了</button></view>
</view>
